BASE-10 through BASE-14 closure
-------------------------------

Header and API contract changes:

[PASS] Every application response now carries
Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy=same-origin and X-Content-Type-Options=nosniff.
[PASS] UI responses also carry Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy=require-corp.
[PASS] HTML, JSON and health responses use Cache-Control=no-store; public JS
and CSS use an explicit five-minute cache with versioned URLs.
