Environment note
----------------

The IDE session's default `python` points to a shared Hermes environment and
`python -m pip check` there reports unrelated package conflicts. All authoritative
project checks above were rerun with .\.venv\Scripts\python.exe, where pip check
passes. Do not use the shared interpreter as release evidence.

